{
  "body" : "You are designing a minimalist cel-shaded illustration with surreal and dreamlike qualities.\n\nCONTENT BRIEF\n- Character: {{character}}\n- Setting: {{setting}}\n- Copy: {{copy}}\n\nSTYLE DIRECTION\n- Genre / medium: minimalist cel-shaded illustration\n- Composition: centered, dynamic falling motion; the character occupies most of the vertical space with surrounding negative space emphasizing simplicity\n- Lens / camera: orthographic perspective with no distortion\n- Lighting: flat and even, no shadows; emphasis on clean color separation\n- Color palette and grading: muted tones dominated by cool blues, soft purples, and neutral whites; occasional black accents for contrast\n- Texture / surface: smooth, clean vector-like finish with no visible brushstrokes\n- Post-processing: no halation, glow, or grain; pure clean edges and minimal layering effects\n- Mood: surreal, ethereal, tranquil\n- References: Studio Ghibli-inspired cel-shading, minimalist manga art styles, ethereal indie illustration aesthetics\n\nDESIGN RULES\n- Aspect: 2:3 portrait (~1024×1536) suitable for standalone posters or prints\n- Maintain ample negative space around the subject to enhance focus and simplicity\n- Ensure all elements are cleanly defined with strong contour lines and minimal visual noise\n\nAVOID\n- No overly detailed or textured backgrounds\n- No harsh gradients or artificial lighting effects\n- No clutter or busy compositions\n- No overly vibrant or saturated colors\n- No realistic shading or photorealistic textures\n\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\n\n——————\nCharacter: {{character}}\nSetting: {{setting}}\nCopy: {{copy}}\nExtra notes: {{extra}}",
